
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant STT as Gnani STT
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant TTS as Gnani TTS

    User->>FE: Record Hindi/English audio
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/voice/chat
    API->>STT: Send audio
    STT-->>API: Transcript

    API->>API: Load session context
    API->>LLM: Transcript + conversation history
    LLM-->>API: Generated response
    API->>API: Update in-memory session

    API->>TTS: Synthesize response
    TTS-->>API: Audio

    API-->>FE: Transcript + reply + audio
    FE->>User: Display text and play audio

    Note over FE,API: REST, push-to-talk, non-streaming
    Note over API,TTS: Record stage-level latency
